{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194840/extras/c7c0461116f88e54377efc5a7b8fdea8.avif?t=1757065540\" data-has-big width=800 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194840/extras/225090e8bec8173cb522f5560e1e17f5.poster.avif?t=1757065540\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194840/extras/225090e8bec8173cb522f5560e1e17f5.webm?t=1757065540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spring Tales is a cozy 2D puzzle adventure game. Help the charming residents of Blossomdale prepare for their spring festival by solving puzzles, overcoming challenges, and rebuilding after a storm. Experience a heartwarming story filled with friendship, hope, and community spirit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194840/extras/b78ff556056da8e20e8d7855e16c5791.avif?t=1757065540\" data-has-big width=800 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194840/extras/58117daa6fd4571ed9b60436ad8f1b9f.poster.avif?t=1757065540\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194840/extras/58117daa6fd4571ed9b60436ad8f1b9f.webm?t=1757065540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spring Tales welcomes you to Blossomdale, a cozy town where the community is coming together to prepare for a spring festival after a devastating storm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll follow the lives of five unique characters as they navigate the challenges of recovery and festival preparation. You\u2019ll help them solve puzzles and discover their stories along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194840/extras/d09b3bbfdb3aadb897916a9d67868d11.avif?t=1757065540\" data-has-big width=800 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194840/extras/e55e965848979132a1c09049e3001145.poster.avif?t=1757065540\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194840/extras/e55e965848979132a1c09049e3001145.webm?t=1757065540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Spring Tales</i> offers a variety of puzzles that challenge your skills in stacking, sorting, and mixing different elements. From fixing electrical circuits to organizing objects in the right order, each puzzle provides a new, creative challenge that keeps the gameplay fresh and exciting, with endless combinations to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194840/extras/c40470c343f883024bd755acf4fae278.poster.avif?t=1757065540\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194840/extras/c40470c343f883024bd755acf4fae278.webm?t=1757065540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the lives of five characters, each with their own story and role in the festival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the hand-drawn visuals that bring the town and its people to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles that are woven into the story and help the characters on their journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a break and immerse yourself in the calming, cozy world of Blossomdale.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the warmth of a community coming together to rebuild, heal, and celebrate after a storm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3194840?t=1757065540","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3194840?t=1757065540","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194840/ccfd67fa64f077c52ac11b4e3e833ebfa1fb9566/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757065540","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194840/ccfd67fa64f077c52ac11b4e3e833ebfa1fb9566/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757065540","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3580120,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194840/extras/c7c0461116f88e54377efc5a7b8fdea8.avif?t=1757065540\" data-has-big width=800 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p 