 help them solve puzzles and discover their stories along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194840/extras/d09b3bbfdb3aadb897916a9d67868d11.avif?t=1757065540\" data-has-big width=800 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194840/extras/e55e965848979132a1c09049e3001145.poster.avif?t=1757065540\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194840/extras/e55e965848979132a1c09049e3001145.webm?t=1757065540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Spring Tales</i> offers a variety of puzzles that challenge your skills in stacking, sorting, and mixing different elements. From fixing electrical circuits to organizing objects in the right order, each puzzle provides a new, creative challenge that keeps the gameplay fresh and exciting, with endless combinations to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194840/extras/c40470c343f883024bd755acf4fae278.poster.avif?t=1757065540\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194840/extras/c40470c343f883024bd755acf4fae278.webm?t=1757065540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the lives of five characters, each with their own story and role in the festival.</p></li><li><p cla